</strong><span>According to Natalie, one way to prevent damage to the castle site would be to</span></span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>insist visitors have a guide.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>make visitors keep to the paths.</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"radio\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>limit visitor numbers.</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cambridge-ielts-12-academic-listening-3-audio-3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-c12-t3-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/12183-cambridge-ielts-12-academic-listening-3-audio-4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-c12-t3-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the notes below.</p><p><em>Write&nbsp;<strong>ONE WORD ONLY</strong>&nbsp;for each answer.</em></p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong><strong>The effects of environmental change on birds</strong></strong></p><p><strong>Mercury (Hg)</strong></p><ul><li>Highly toxic</li><li>Released into the atmosphere from coal</li><li>In water it may be consumed by fish</li><li>It has also recently been found to affect birds which feed on <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul><p><strong>Research on effects of mercury on birds</strong></p><ul><li>Claire Varian-Ramos is investigating</li></ul><p>–&nbsp; the effects on birds’ <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;or mental processes, e.g. memory</p><p>–&nbsp; the effects on bird song (usually learned from a bird’s <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>)</p><ul><li>Findings:</li></ul><p>–&nbsp; songs learned by birds exposed to mercury are less <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>–&nbsp; this may have a negative effect on birds’ <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><ul><li>Lab-based studies</li></ul><p>–&nbsp; allow more <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;for the experimenter</p><p><strong>Implications for humans</strong></p><ul><li>Migrating birds such as <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;containing mercury may be eaten by humans</li><li>Mercury also causes problems in learning <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>Mercury in a mother’s body from <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;may affect the unborn child</li><li>New regulations for mercury emissions will affect everyone’s energy <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c12-t3-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cambridge-ielts-12-academic-listening-3-audio-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-c12-t3-l-q1","part_id":"en-c12-t3-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t3-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"travel/traveling/travelling","correct_answer_variants":["travel","traveling","travelling"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12166_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-c12-t3-l-q2","part_id":"en-c12-t3-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t3-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"history","correct_answer_variants":["history"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12166_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-c12-t3-l-q3","part_id":"en-c12-t3-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t3-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_ans